msgid ""
"Hitec supplies several `linear actuators "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__"
" that support the DroneCAN protocol using the same commands and feedback as "
"are used for servos.  Before purchasing, ensure the product description "
"includes the word \"DroneCAN\"."
msgstr ""
"Hitec 提供多种 `线性执行器 "
"<https://www.hiteccs.com/actuators/products/search/servo/2/spec/0-0/accessory/0/sort/0>`__，支持"
" DroneCAN 协议，使用与舵机相同的命令和反馈。购买前请确认产品描述中包含「DroneCAN」字样。"

